-- src:774 | At the option of a State agency, no individual shall be eligible to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program as a member of any household during any month that the individual is delinquent in any payment due under a court order for the support of a child of the individual.
-- src:775 | (2) Exceptions
-- src:776 | Paragraph (1) shall not apply if—
-- src:777 | (A) a court is allowing the individual to delay payment; or
-- src:778 | (B) the individual is complying with a payment plan approved by a court or the State agency designated under part D of title IV of the Social Security Act (42 U.S.C. 651 et seq.) to provide support for the child of the individual.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2015(n) (src:774-778)
GIVEN `the State agency has chosen to apply this subsection` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual is delinquent during the month in a payment due under a court order for the support of a child of the individual` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a court is allowing the individual to delay payment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual is complying with a payment plan approved by a court or by the State agency designated under part D of title IV` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2015(n) the individual is ineligible for the month for child support arrears` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "At the option of a State agency"
        IF NOT `the State agency has chosen to apply this subsection` THEN NOTHING
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "during any month that the individual is delinquent in any payment due under a court order" (reading (a): a failed condition)
        IF NOT `the individual is delinquent during the month in a payment due under a court order for the support of a child of the individual` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Paragraph (1) shall not apply if— (A) a court is allowing the individual to delay payment; or (B) the individual is complying with a payment plan"
        IF `a court is allowing the individual to delay payment` OR `the individual is complying with a payment plan approved by a court or by the State agency designated under part D of title IV` THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
